WEBVTT

01:56.609 --> 01:59.993
I've been walking a tightrope
as long as I can remember.

02:01.224 --> 02:06.196
Because this is the only path to accepting
that I am who I think I am.

02:08.873 --> 02:10.276
There's no lifeline.

02:10.990 --> 02:12.184
Falling means death.

02:13.409 --> 02:17.384
So no matter what happens,
I can't let myself fall.

02:18.707 --> 02:20.683
Because there's nobody to save me.

02:22.726 --> 02:24.898
My muscles are always tensed up,

02:25.610 --> 02:30.160
and my breaths are pained and
shallow, but I'm used to it.

02:31.729 --> 02:34.676
Living as a human is no easy task.

02:36.018 --> 02:37.655
Adults said that a lot.

02:39.440 --> 02:44.633
So I thought, even if it's hard,
this is just how life is.

02:48.147 --> 02:48.855
But…

02:49.747 --> 02:51.052
It's not.

02:51.876 --> 02:53.729
This isn't the only path.

02:54.860 --> 02:59.587
And if there's somewhere I can stand at
peace, breathing free with no tension,

03:00.873 --> 03:03.033
where I don't have to fear falling…

03:04.898 --> 03:05.710
Then I'll…

03:18.701 --> 03:21.298
Do you think Sakura's taking today off, too?

03:21.600 --> 03:25.033
Hmm… There. Sent him a message.

03:25.821 --> 03:26.523
Check it!

03:26.929 --> 03:30.498
Figgered I'd take 'im some
protein if he missed today!

03:30.603 --> 03:31.169
Eh?

03:31.593 --> 03:33.360
Don't you have that every day?

03:33.513 --> 03:35.236
This is my spare!

03:45.895 --> 03:46.978
Sakura!

03:49.489 --> 03:54.209
Good morning! We were worried
you might miss today, too!

03:54.424 --> 03:56.209
You're looking better today.

03:56.393 --> 03:59.003
Guess even you catch fevers sometimes!

03:59.218 --> 04:00.843
Of course he does, Kiryu!

04:01.255 --> 04:04.449
Even I get sick when I work out too much.

04:04.683 --> 04:06.892
And how much is "too much"?

04:07.581 --> 04:08.209
Huh?

04:08.836 --> 04:10.652
What's wrong, Sakura?

04:11.015 --> 04:13.981
Are you still feeling a little sick?

04:25.415 --> 04:27.076
So don't worry.

04:27.729 --> 04:30.227
And jump right in!

04:34.073 --> 04:34.609
I…

04:35.710 --> 04:36.836
I have something…

04:39.396 --> 04:40.781
to tell you guys.

04:45.956 --> 04:50.240
I-I've always felt…

04:50.916 --> 04:54.000
like it was normal to do everything myself.

04:54.843 --> 04:57.126
Like that was the only way to live.

04:58.449 --> 05:00.750
But I couldn't…

05:02.080 --> 05:05.353
And what's worse, I got pissed at myself,

05:06.092 --> 05:08.307
then took it out on you.

05:09.150 --> 05:11.390
I'm so weak… So lame…

05:12.701 --> 05:15.489
You're probably disappointed
to have me as our rep.

05:16.461 --> 05:18.209
But that's how I am.

05:21.187 --> 05:21.938
So…

05:23.532 --> 05:26.775
I'm pretty sure I'll cause more problems,

05:30.215 --> 05:33.796
like I did before…

05:35.575 --> 05:36.129
So…

05:38.689 --> 05:39.501
So…

05:44.178 --> 05:46.012
I'm… sorry…

06:00.732 --> 06:02.240
S-Sakura?!

06:02.861 --> 06:06.116
O-O-Owww… The hell is your problem?!

06:06.683 --> 06:09.181
You standing there.

06:10.775 --> 06:12.012
Nice one, Sugishita!

06:12.307 --> 06:14.012
And pow!

06:15.932 --> 06:18.067
Wh-What…?

06:18.301 --> 06:20.596
Sakura, you son of a bitch!

06:21.347 --> 06:23.630
Quit spouting crap!

06:24.972 --> 06:26.406
Sa-ku-ra.

06:27.027 --> 06:29.156
Aren't you being a bit rude?

06:29.280 --> 06:32.233
No kiddin'. That ain't aesthetic.

06:33.095 --> 06:34.264
I'm insulted.

06:35.760 --> 06:40.369
You're acting like it's a big reveal
you're lame or whatever,

06:40.732 --> 06:45.384
when anyone can tell at a glance you're
an awkward, annoying musclehead!

06:46.289 --> 06:48.326
But so what?!

06:50.540 --> 06:57.200
Who in the hell would be disappointed in a
straight shooter feeling hurt when he's hurt?

06:57.956 --> 07:00.701
You go so far for us like it's nothing,

07:01.070 --> 07:04.861
so why would you apologize
when we try to repay you?

07:06.006 --> 07:10.098
Did you think we were upset that you helped us?

07:10.947 --> 07:12.135
Screw that!

07:12.910 --> 07:15.975
Nobody here feels that way!

07:18.381 --> 07:20.609
You may be awkward and annoying,

07:20.966 --> 07:24.080
but you charge straight ahead for your friends!

07:24.713 --> 07:26.935
You're cool, and I… We…

07:27.993 --> 07:29.483
like you a whole damn lot!

08:19.458 --> 08:20.701
I feel so light.

08:23.101 --> 08:24.449
It's easier to breathe.

08:26.701 --> 08:28.270
If this place is real…

08:33.526 --> 08:34.615
I want to stay.

08:35.963 --> 08:37.027
To stay right here.

08:42.990 --> 08:48.880
Sakura, causing and dealing with
problems aren't bad things.

08:49.729 --> 08:52.086
It seems you've always been alone,

08:52.449 --> 08:54.030
so it might be hard now,

08:54.713 --> 08:57.470
but you can take your time to adjust.

09:00.713 --> 09:05.206
Nope! All that aside, our grade
rep doesn't get us at all!

09:05.366 --> 09:06.916
No kidding!

09:07.446 --> 09:08.873
You heard 'em, Sakura!

09:09.292 --> 09:13.089
So after school, we're having a
social gathering! With food!

09:13.341 --> 09:16.276
Y-You just want the food.

09:16.467 --> 09:18.141
Nice idea! I vote yakiniku!

09:18.196 --> 09:20.104
I can't afford that, dumbass!

09:20.160 --> 09:21.064
Chicken skewers!

09:21.095 --> 09:21.686
Monja!

09:21.723 --> 09:22.289
Cake!

09:22.424 --> 09:25.230
Sakura, you pick! Anything works!

09:25.298 --> 09:28.196
Huh?! Is deciding this the grade rep's job?

09:28.584 --> 09:31.144
I think you should just go with what you want.

09:31.446 --> 09:34.320
Huh? What I want?

09:37.181 --> 09:39.934
- Meat meat meat meat meat!
- Monja monja monja monja monja!

09:39.934 --> 09:42.686
- Cake cake cake cake cake!
- Skewers skewers skewers skewers skewers!

09:43.987 --> 09:44.590
R…

09:45.495 --> 09:46.806
Rice omelettes.

09:48.886 --> 09:50.320
Ooh, good idea.

09:50.436 --> 09:52.147
So we're going to Pothos?

09:52.264 --> 09:53.698
Will we all fit?

09:53.760 --> 09:55.938
Their fried onigiri are great, too!

09:56.043 --> 09:57.372
Huh? They are?!

09:57.741 --> 10:00.707
Sakura, I'm glad you're feeling better.

10:03.292 --> 10:04.713
Is something wrong, Nire?

10:04.867 --> 10:07.107
Eh? Uh, what?

10:08.270 --> 10:09.600
Are you feeling okay?

10:10.030 --> 10:13.661
Normally you'd cut in when
Sakura says something wimpy.

10:16.135 --> 10:18.812
Ah, I've been a bit spacey today.

10:19.156 --> 10:22.984
That aside, I'm glad you're
feeling better, Sakura.

10:23.811 --> 10:24.854
[Café Pothos]

10:24.854 --> 10:25.563
[Café Pothos]
Huh?!

10:25.956 --> 10:28.732
Make a rice omelette for each of you?!

10:28.898 --> 10:32.030
Are you guys idiots? This isn't a restaurant!

10:32.123 --> 10:33.409
Order some tea! Tea!

10:33.501 --> 10:34.760
Aww, come on, please?

10:34.760 --> 10:36.861
You make the world's best omelettes!

10:37.464 --> 10:39.003
You have to be kidding me.

10:40.553 --> 10:41.643
Sakura?

10:41.704 --> 10:42.904
Oh, hey.

10:44.092 --> 10:45.550
Are you feeling better?

10:48.049 --> 10:50.793
Sorry about yesterday.

10:51.366 --> 10:53.341
I'll give the bowl back next time.

10:55.427 --> 10:57.655
The hell? Do you still have a fever?

10:57.889 --> 10:59.316
Huh? What?!

10:59.415 --> 11:02.116
Get moving! You're the key player!

11:02.172 --> 11:04.043
I get it already, stop pushing!

11:04.375 --> 11:05.581
Key player?

11:06.824 --> 11:09.310
Pothos's rice omelettes really are the best!

11:09.390 --> 11:10.689
Yeah, for reals!

11:11.230 --> 11:14.086
And I just bought eggs yesterday…

11:14.621 --> 11:15.507
Alright!

11:16.547 --> 11:19.495
Sakura confessed his lame points,

11:20.227 --> 11:23.236
so it's time for a lameness exposition marathon!

11:23.889 --> 11:24.910
O-Okay!

11:25.033 --> 11:26.430
You start, Takanashi!

11:26.504 --> 11:27.710
It was your idea!

11:28.670 --> 11:29.987
Alright…

11:30.363 --> 11:31.538
The truth is…

11:32.369 --> 11:34.024
I can't handle bugs.

11:36.670 --> 11:38.615
Especially hard ones' soft bellies.

11:38.966 --> 11:41.015
Just thinking about them makes me so…

11:41.206 --> 11:43.280
And yet you're such a good fighter.

11:43.360 --> 11:45.076
What a surprising weakness!

11:45.396 --> 11:47.778
'Kay, I'll go next.

11:48.603 --> 11:49.267
I…

11:49.870 --> 11:50.873
I'm…

11:52.295 --> 11:54.406
scared of ghosts!

11:55.076 --> 11:59.187
I can't go to the bathroom without
turnin' on the lights,

11:59.446 --> 12:02.400
and can't close my eyes when I shampoo!

12:03.440 --> 12:05.138
Doesn't that hurt your eyes?

12:05.335 --> 12:08.836
It does! But it's better'n closin' 'em!

12:09.070 --> 12:11.107
They scare you, too, right, Sakura?!

12:11.304 --> 12:14.535
I mean, no amount of muscle
can let ya beat up a ghost!

12:14.756 --> 12:16.658
You can't even touch 'em!

12:16.660 --> 12:19.526
I get it! I get it already! Put your coat back on!

12:19.784 --> 12:21.378
I'm glad you understand.

12:22.473 --> 12:24.104
We're all the same, see?

12:27.532 --> 12:30.923
Everyone has their weaknesses,
their uncool points.

12:31.704 --> 12:35.563
So it's nothing to be afraid or embarrassed about.

12:36.381 --> 12:38.793
Everyone is like that.

12:39.513 --> 12:42.080
So what's your weakness, then, Suo?

12:42.516 --> 12:45.840
Mine? Manju scare me, I guess!

12:46.178 --> 12:48.603
Suo, isn't that from a skit?

12:48.707 --> 12:49.335
Huh?

12:49.612 --> 12:52.283
Manju? As in the food?

12:52.646 --> 12:54.443
Did one give you food poisoning?

12:54.584 --> 12:57.100
Look, Sakura actually believed you.

12:57.100 --> 12:58.633
Wha?! He was lying?!

12:58.947 --> 13:01.747
Well, I couldn't think of anything.

13:02.184 --> 13:02.676
Huh?

13:02.775 --> 13:06.356
But Suo, don't you actually hate natto?

13:08.412 --> 13:11.895
Poor Nire, where did you hear that nonsense?

13:12.310 --> 13:17.169
I asked a bunch of people about you,
but I don't remember who said it.

13:19.729 --> 13:21.236
Kotoha! Kotoha!

13:21.784 --> 13:22.867
Have any natto?

13:23.353 --> 13:25.089
Why the hell would I?

13:25.796 --> 13:27.347
Aight, I'mma go buy some!

13:28.923 --> 13:31.415
This party's about Sakura, you know.

13:31.476 --> 13:33.716
Hey, somebody, hold Suo back!

13:33.720 --> 13:35.169
Let go, would you?

13:35.273 --> 13:36.966
You seem awful desperate.

13:37.089 --> 13:38.221
No, not at all!

13:38.338 --> 13:42.436
- But it's not nice to abandon Sakura here!
- Hey, it's free food. Why hold back, huh?

13:50.363 --> 13:50.941
Huh?

13:55.261 --> 13:57.452
Wh-What?

13:59.612 --> 14:00.947
See that, Suo?!

14:01.095 --> 14:03.433
If you eat some natto, he'll laugh more!

14:03.950 --> 14:08.147
Sakura, you can't sell your smiles so cheaply.

14:08.818 --> 14:11.316
- They're a rare, precious thing!
- See? I told you.

14:11.796 --> 14:14.430
Furin was the right choice for you.

14:15.403 --> 14:17.298
Good for you, Sakura.

14:19.126 --> 14:22.000
Now we just wait for Suo's natto!

14:22.221 --> 14:24.184
That's not why we're here.

14:25.341 --> 14:26.738
Hm? What's this?

14:27.009 --> 14:28.603
It's Sakura and his guys!

14:29.003 --> 14:31.606
All of them? Is this a class party?

14:32.000 --> 14:33.366
Looks like fun!

14:33.932 --> 14:35.187
Wonder what they're…

14:36.049 --> 14:38.196
You are absolutely not allowed in there.

14:38.566 --> 14:40.578
Not after this morning.

14:40.664 --> 14:41.643
Whaaat?

14:41.981 --> 14:45.156
But they're having so much fun. I wanna join in!

14:45.378 --> 14:47.440
Dude, read the room.

15:11.649 --> 15:12.713
Wow!

15:13.089 --> 15:15.409
The seedlings have grown so much!

15:15.550 --> 15:18.609
They sure have. The days are getting longer,

15:18.720 --> 15:20.596
and nights are warmer, too.

15:21.661 --> 15:24.621
Even the sakura trees went green in a flash.

15:25.833 --> 15:27.083
What I want to know…

15:27.907 --> 15:29.470
is what we're all here for.

15:31.224 --> 15:33.187
We were just about to go home, when…

15:33.501 --> 15:37.513
Everyone without patrols or other
business, come to the roof!

15:38.504 --> 15:42.227
Looks like we got everyone
from first-years to third,

15:42.812 --> 15:44.867
but what are we all doing here?

15:45.218 --> 15:46.793
Nothing in particular.

15:47.667 --> 15:50.910
It's Umemiya's policy to have
gatherings once in a while,

15:51.181 --> 15:53.784
so he can talk to all sorts of folks.

15:54.061 --> 15:54.781
Yo!

15:55.089 --> 15:56.307
Good work out there.

15:56.518 --> 15:57.144
[Tamon, Jikoku, Zocho, Komoku]

15:57.144 --> 16:00.689
[Tamon, Jikoku, Zocho, Komoku]
Bofurin is split by class numbers, after all.

16:00.689 --> 16:01.023
[Tamon, Jikoku, Zocho, Komoku]

16:01.636 --> 16:04.793
Umemiya does want to talk to all sorts of folks,

16:05.489 --> 16:09.120
but he also wanted to bring everyone
together, regardless of squad.

16:09.458 --> 16:11.680
That's why he says he made these meetings.

16:15.427 --> 16:17.316
Mhm, mhm. I see.

16:17.723 --> 16:21.680
And he also wants a bunch of people
to see how his plants are growing.

16:21.981 --> 16:25.236
Take a look! Feast your eyes! Aren't they cute?!

16:27.575 --> 16:30.172
Sugishita looks like a tour guide.

16:30.350 --> 16:33.624
We were just talking about
how big they'd grown, too!

16:34.006 --> 16:36.990
Tell him that. He'll cry tears of joy.

16:37.138 --> 16:38.812
What else is there to drink?

16:49.778 --> 16:51.033
That woman…

16:51.846 --> 16:53.175
She was at Pothos.

16:54.775 --> 16:55.280
Hm?

16:58.190 --> 16:59.581
Huh? Eh?!

17:01.126 --> 17:03.255
She's way too tall!

17:04.116 --> 17:05.895
We finally meet!

17:06.227 --> 17:07.766
Such a husky voice!

17:08.806 --> 17:10.147
Ts-Tsubakino!

17:11.760 --> 17:14.160
Y-Y-Y-You're a man?!

17:14.289 --> 17:18.320
Hey! Sakura, you're being rude to Tsubakino!

17:18.535 --> 17:20.898
He's one of the four devas, you know!

17:21.267 --> 17:22.873
It's fine, it's fine.

17:23.286 --> 17:26.603
This may surprise you, but we
have the same equipment.

17:27.236 --> 17:28.541
But please, I'd prefer…

17:30.449 --> 17:33.015
if you called me Tsubaki!

17:34.129 --> 17:38.412
Um, M-Mr. Tsubaki, do you know about Sakura?

17:38.775 --> 17:41.236
With moves like his? How couldn't I?

17:41.796 --> 17:44.080
And that "Mr." sounds funny.

17:45.015 --> 17:46.843
But really, he stands out.

17:49.446 --> 17:51.304
I love the way you look!

17:51.913 --> 17:53.630
You rock those eyes and hair!

17:54.060 --> 17:57.920
The simplicity of your uniform emphasizes
it, and the length is perfect!

17:58.116 --> 18:01.212
And the white is a great match for your skin, too!

18:01.267 --> 18:03.729
Wh-Wh-What are you trying to say?

18:03.730 --> 18:05.120
And really, Sakura,

18:05.440 --> 18:09.612
Tsubaki was at the meet-and-greet.
Did you not think it was odd then?

18:09.969 --> 18:11.267
This is a boys' school.

18:11.538 --> 18:15.600
Shut up! I figured he was supposed to
be there, so I didn't think about it!

18:15.710 --> 18:16.627
Weird excuse.

18:17.575 --> 18:20.603
I bet you thought guys never dress like this.

18:21.058 --> 18:24.049
Sorry. I hope you can get used to it!

18:24.295 --> 18:24.867
Wha…?

18:25.144 --> 18:28.178
I-It's fine, I was just a little surprised.

18:28.950 --> 18:32.756
It's not bad or anything.
You don't have to apologize.

18:42.596 --> 18:46.387
Wooow, you're so straightforward! What a good kid!

18:46.443 --> 18:47.427
Sakura!

18:47.766 --> 18:50.184
Hey, Tsubaki. Let him breathe.

18:50.756 --> 18:52.633
Oh, my! Sorry.

18:52.904 --> 18:54.400
U-Um…

18:54.806 --> 18:56.301
Let me introduce you.

18:56.898 --> 18:59.083
These two are my next-in-commands.

18:59.483 --> 19:02.400
This is Sakaki Seiryu, the older brother,

19:03.083 --> 19:05.212
and this is Uryu, the younger brother.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.403
Play nice, okay?

19:12.455 --> 19:16.289
I thought you wore a color contact,
but this is the real deal!

19:16.473 --> 19:19.396
And the hair's real, too! You have natural style!

19:20.652 --> 19:23.390
You'll upset Sakura if you ogle him like that!

19:23.753 --> 19:25.790
I like being ogled, though.

19:26.006 --> 19:27.846
I don't wanna hear that.

19:28.116 --> 19:30.910
Hey! Does everyone have a drink?

19:31.476 --> 19:35.163
Get a load of this! Today we've got
Umemiya Special pork soup!

19:35.273 --> 19:36.510
Eat up!

19:37.200 --> 19:38.338
Be right there!

19:44.455 --> 19:45.889
I'll have some!

19:49.101 --> 19:50.036
Deeelish!

19:50.330 --> 19:53.200
It's perfectly seasoned!
You could open a restaurant!

19:54.498 --> 19:56.018
Maybe I should!

19:56.326 --> 19:57.981
- I could call it Bofurin!
- Try some, Sakura!

19:58.203 --> 20:00.935
- Everything you make is delicious!
- S-Sure…

20:01.304 --> 20:02.713
Oh, you…

20:03.310 --> 20:05.206
I'm falling in love again, again!

20:11.280 --> 20:12.880
This really warms you up!

20:13.144 --> 20:14.886
It's tasty, right, Sakura?

20:18.726 --> 20:21.421
Oh, my, what's wrong? You're beet red.

20:21.630 --> 20:24.116
Wow, he is. Was it that hot?

20:24.633 --> 20:27.304
Ahh, about this…

20:27.969 --> 20:32.996
Sakura is especially sensitive to
romantic gestures and moods,

20:33.181 --> 20:35.778
so even the slightest thing turns him red.

20:36.455 --> 20:42.073
And so, Tsubaki, I think he's just responding
to the vibes between you and Umemiya.

20:44.283 --> 20:46.338
Tsubaki's easy to read, after all!

20:46.467 --> 20:48.283
I'm a dunce, and even I can tell!

20:48.553 --> 20:51.206
You might not guess, but he tries to hide it.

20:51.329 --> 20:53.612
Mhm. All my guys know already.

20:53.772 --> 20:55.667
Oh, youuu!

20:56.880 --> 21:00.166
W-Well, it is true.

21:00.652 --> 21:03.384
That aside, Sakura, you're real innocent, huh?

21:03.556 --> 21:04.387
Wha?!

21:04.553 --> 21:05.864
And you're red again.

21:07.716 --> 21:08.867
Sorry.

21:10.756 --> 21:12.560
No. Don't be.

21:14.670 --> 21:17.440
You responded honestly to my feelings.

21:19.286 --> 21:20.190
Thank you.

21:25.218 --> 21:26.990
Oh, hey, Tsubaki.

21:27.876 --> 21:29.692
Don't we need to get going?

21:30.067 --> 21:31.840
Oh, my! I totally forgot!

21:32.295 --> 21:33.821
You're still going there?

21:34.320 --> 21:37.643
We are! We're off, Ume. See you.

21:38.018 --> 21:40.135
Sure. Take care.

21:47.200 --> 21:48.375
What now?

21:49.126 --> 21:49.883
Sakura…

21:51.249 --> 21:52.830
Wanna go on a date with me?

21:53.421 --> 21:54.486
A d-d-d-d-d…

21:54.787 --> 21:56.633
Date?!

21:57.045 --> 22:00.048
[Safe Haven]

23:30.683 --> 23:33.507
I'm so glad Sakura's back to his usual self!

23:33.600 --> 23:34.898
Mhm. Me, too.

23:34.960 --> 23:36.566
That reminds me! Suo!

23:36.640 --> 23:37.323
Yes?

23:37.427 --> 23:39.833
What makes you not like natto?

23:40.172 --> 23:41.723
Some past trauma?

